"P2538957486" "Okay, {VillainName} - it's go time! We've got the profile on the prisoner you need to break out of the Zag, and the Hyper-Jammer which will allow us to acquire the security door passcodes without setting off alarms. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You'll need to steal the passcodes and plant the Hyper-Jammer in the Longbow base, then break James O'Clary out of the Zag.</A><br><br>Once the Hyper-Jammer is in place you'll only have a short time before they discover the device. <color orange>You'll have about 90 minutes to bust James O'Clary from the Zag.</color>"
